flowchart LR
  U[User] -->|Query| UI[Streamlit UI]
  UI -->|Prompt + Session State| AG[LangGraph Agent Workflow]

  AG -->|Tool Calls| TN[ToolNode]
  TN -->|search_web| W[DuckDuckGo Web Search]
  TN -->|get_news| N[News API]
  TN -->|duckduckgo_news| D[DuckDuckGo News]
  W -->|Results| TN
  N -->|Results| TN
  D -->|Results| TN
  TN -->|Tool Messages| AG

  AG -->|LLM Invoke| G[Gemini 3 Flash Preview]
  G -->|AI Message / Tool Calls| AG

  AG -->|Final State| RP[Report Parser]
  RP -->|Valid Markdown Report| UI
  RP -->|Empty Output or MALFORMED_FUNCTION_CALL| FB[Fallback Synthesizer]
  FB -->|Direct Tool Fetch + Gemini Synthesis| UI

  UI -->|Export| MD[Download .md]
  UI -->|Export| PDF[Download .pdf]

  subgraph Stack["Runtime Stack (Upgraded)"]
    LC[langchain >= 1.3.1]
    LCC[langchain-core >= 1.4.0]
    LCG[langchain-google-genai >= 4.2.2]
    LG[langgraph >= 1.2.0]
  end

  LC -.-> AG
  LCC -.-> AG
  LCG -.-> G
